            0.219,
            0.857,
            0.275
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "After having learnt that light travels in a straight line and is reflected by mirrors, it is time to "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "create",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " some useful items based on this learning."
